  "goodToKnow": "Die Messlatte is literally a measuring rod, and figuratively the bar or standard: die Messlatte hoch legen (set the bar high), die Messlatte reißen (fail to meet it). It comes from the high jump bar. Die Latte also means the crossbar in football: an die Latte (hit the bar). Synonym: der Maßstab. Plural: die Messlatten."
